      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA WILD (6) is progressing well with another good run, placing by a nose (30.34) in a Mix at Taree Super Track. Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Can go on with it. LAGRANGE (3) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (29.76) at Gosford. Returns to a course where he has performed well. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Shapes as one to consider. IONA HUNTRIX (1) was a little disappointing last start at Richmond when 8th (24.06) over 401m. Has won here at this journey. The form out of her last race has been franked. Cannot be underestimated. JAMATI GIRL (8) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
